Z||000000||PBJ||07-11-2001||10:02 PM||||I did a search and came up with links to remove and re-install.  They use 3m double sided tape.<P>My question. For those who have used double sided tape. Does it work well? Does it sit out properly or is it sitting in too far?<P>I used butal tape (designed for windshields) but after 2-3 months the windows just pulled away.  And it was thoroughly cleaned.<P>What have others used successfully?????<P>Thanks.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/petesigsm.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by PBJ (edited 07-11-2001).]||||reg||5
Z||000001||stimpy||07-11-2001||11:30 PM||||3M double sided tape works fine. If you are worried that the kind you get at the auto parts store might not stick well enough, then go to a sign supply store and get the thickkind that has the red backing. It'll hold forever.||||reg||1
